{"seq":3,"slug":"ci-cd-for-ml","title":"ML 持续集成与交付","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/pipeline/ci-cd-for-ml","wordCount":1066,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"ml-持续集成与交付\">ML 持续集成与交付</h1><p>软件工程的 CI/CD 在 ML 世界不能直接套用——因为你不仅要验证代码能编译通过，还要验证数据质量合格、模型性能达标、推理延迟在 SLA 之内。ML CI/CD 需要在传统的代码流水线之上叠加数据验证和模型验证两条额外的管道。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>ML CI/CD 扩展了传统 CI/CD 的触发器和验证维度：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[代码变更] --&gt; D[CI Pipeline]&#10;    B[数据变更] --&gt; D&#10;    C[配置变更] --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; E[代码测试]&#10;    D --&gt; F[数据验证]&#10;    D --&gt; G[训练流水线]&#10;    G --&gt; H[模型验证]&#10;    H --&gt; I{达标?}&#10;    I --&gt;|是| J[CD Pipeline]&#10;    I --&gt;|否| K[通知 + 阻断]&#10;    J --&gt; L[影子部署]&#10;    L --&gt; M[金丝雀发布]&#10;    M --&gt; N[全量上线]\">graph TD\n    A[代码变更] --&gt; D[CI Pipeline]\n    B[数据变更] --&gt; D\n    C[配置变更] --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; E[代码测试]\n    D --&gt; F[数据验证]\n    D --&gt; G[训练流水线]\n    G --&gt; H[模型验证]\n    H --&gt; I{达标?}\n    I --&gt;|是| J[CD Pipeline]\n    I --&gt;|否| K[通知 + 阻断]\n    J --&gt; L[影子部署]\n    L --&gt; M[金丝雀发布]\n    M --&gt; N[全量上线]</pre><p>传统 CI/CD 与 ML CI/CD 的关键差异：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>传统 CI/CD</th>\n<th>ML CI/CD</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>触发源</td>\n<td>代码提交</td>\n<td>代码/数据/模型性能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构建产物</td>\n<td>二进制/容器</td>\n<td>模型产物 + 服务容器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试类型</td>\n<td>单元/集成/E2E</td>\n<td>+ 数据质量/模型性能/偏差检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>验收标准</td>\n<td>测试通过</td>\n<td>+ 指标达阈值 + 无回退</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回滚对象</td>\n<td>代码版本</td>\n<td>模型版本 + 特征版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流水线时长</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n<td>小时级（含训练）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"持续集成-ci-设计\">持续集成（CI）设计</h2><p>ML 的 CI 阶段覆盖三个验证层：</p>\n<p><strong>Layer 1：代码验证</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>单元测试：特征计算函数、数据转换逻辑、自定义指标</li>\n<li>集成测试：端到端流水线在小数据集上的 smoke test</li>\n<li>lint + type check：确保代码质量门</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Layer 2：数据验证</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Schema 检查：字段类型、非空约束、值域范围</li>\n<li>统计属性检查：均值/方差/分布是否在期望范围</li>\n<li>数据完整性：缺失率、重复率、时间覆盖</li>\n<li>工具：Great Expectations、Pandera、TFX Data Validation</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Layer 3：模型验证</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>性能基线对比：新模型 vs 当前生产模型</li>\n<li>切片分析：在不同子群体上的表现差异</li>\n<li>公平性检查：受保护属性的影响度</li>\n<li>鲁棒性测试：对抗样本 / 边界 case</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 示例：GitHub Actions 中的 ML CI 流水线结构&#10;# .github/workflows/ml-ci.yml&#10;&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;triggers: [push, data-update-webhook]&#10;jobs:&#10;  code-quality:    lint + type-check + unit-tests&#10;  data-validation: schema + statistics + freshness&#10;  train-evaluate:  train on sample → compare to baseline&#10;  model-gate:      if metrics &gt;= threshold → pass&#10;&quot;&quot;&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 示例：GitHub Actions 中的 ML CI 流水线结构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/workflows/ml-ci.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">triggers: [push, data-update-webhook]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">jobs:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  code-quality:    lint + type-check + unit-tests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  data-validation: schema + statistics + freshness</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  train-evaluate:  train on sample → compare to baseline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  model-gate:      if metrics >= threshold → pass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"持续交付-cd-设计\">持续交付（CD）设计</h2><p>ML CD 的核心挑战是：<strong>如何在不确定性更高的情况下安全地把新模型推向生产。</strong> 代码的行为是确定性的——通过测试就可以信任；模型的行为是概率性的——即使离线指标优秀，线上表现也可能不同。</p>\n<p><strong>渐进式发布策略：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>影子模式（Shadow）</strong>：新模型接收真实流量但不影响返回结果，对比新旧模型输出差异</li>\n<li><strong>金丝雀发布（Canary）</strong>：1%→5%→20%→100% 逐步放量，实时监控业务指标</li>\n<li><strong>A/B 测试</strong>：随机分流到新旧模型，统计显著性检验后决定切换</li>\n<li><strong>蓝绿部署</strong>：两套完整环境瞬间切换，适合对延迟敏感的场景</li>\n</ol>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>风险控制</th>\n<th>反馈速度</th>\n<th>实现复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>影子模式</td>\n<td>极高（零影响）</td>\n<td>慢（需积累数据）</td>\n<td>高（双倍资源）</td>\n<td>首次上线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金丝雀</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>常规迭代</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>A/B 测试</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>慢（需统计检验）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>业务指标验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蓝绿</td>\n<td>中（快速回滚）</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低延迟要求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"模型质量门控\">模型质量门控</h2><p>质量门（Quality Gate）是 CI/CD 流水线中的检查点——不满足条件则流水线中断，禁止推进。</p>\n<p><strong>必须通过的门控：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Pass</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mtext>accuracy</mtext><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mtext>accuracy</mtext><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mtext>latency</mtext><mrow><mi>p</mi><mn>99</mn></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><mtext>SLA</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mtext>bias</mtext><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><mtext>threshold</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mtext>data</mtext><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>expected</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Pass} = \\begin{cases} \\text{accuracy}_{new} \\geq \\text{accuracy}_{prod} - \\epsilon \\\\ \\text{latency}_{p99} \\leq \\text{SLA} \\\\ \\text{bias}_{metric} \\leq \\text{threshold} \\\\ \\text{data}_{schema} = \\text{expected} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Pass</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:5.76em;vertical-align:-2.63em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.95em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.592em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.916em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.916em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 916\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V916 H384z M384 0 H504 V916 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.916em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.916em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 916\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V916 H384z M384 0 H504 V916 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.45em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.13em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.13em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">accuracy</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">accuracy</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">latency</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">99</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SLA</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bias</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">threshold</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">data</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">sc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">expected</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.63em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 是允许的性能回退容忍度（通常 0.5%-1%），防止噪声导致频繁阻断。</p>\n<p><strong>MLflow 3.14 的 pytest 集成</strong>是 2026 年质量门控的新实践：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# tests/test_model_quality.py&#10;import mlflow&#10;&#10;def test_model_accuracy_above_baseline():&#10;    results = mlflow.genai.evaluate(&#10;        model=&quot;models:/fraud-detector/latest&quot;,&#10;        data=eval_dataset,&#10;        evaluators=[&quot;mlflow.metrics.genai&quot;],&#10;    )&#10;    assert results.metrics[&quot;accuracy&quot;] &gt;= 0.92\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># tests/test_model_quality.py</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mlflow</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> test_model_accuracy_above_baseline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mlflow.genai.evaluate(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"models:/fraud-detector/latest\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">eval_dataset,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        evaluators</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mlflow.metrics.genai\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results.metrics[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"accuracy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.92</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"gitops-for-ml\">GitOps for ML</h2><p>将 GitOps 理念应用于 ML 系统——<strong>Git 仓库是模型部署的唯一真相源</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>模型配置（版本、服务参数、路由规则）存在 Git 中</li>\n<li>变更通过 PR 审查后合并</li>\n<li>合并自动触发部署流水线</li>\n<li>实际状态与 Git 声明的期望状态自动对账</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这消除了&quot;谁手动改了线上配置&quot;的不可追溯问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>ML CI/CD = 代码验证 + 数据验证 + 模型验证三层叠加</li>\n<li>CI 的三层门：代码质量 → 数据质量 → 模型性能</li>\n<li>CD 使用渐进式发布：影子 → 金丝雀 → A/B → 全量</li>\n<li>质量门控需要设置合理的容忍度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span>，避免噪声阻断</li>\n<li>GitOps 让模型部署的变更可追溯、可审计</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../mlops-model-deployment/pipeline/ci-cd-ml\">MLOps 模型部署：CI/CD for ML</a> — 更基础的 ML CI/CD 流程</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../ai-llm/llm-app-eval-observability/offline-evaluation/ci-release-gates\">LLM 应用评估：CI 发布门控</a> — GenAI 场景的质量门设计</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ML 持续集成与交付","id":"ml-持续集成与交付"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"持续集成（CI）设计","id":"持续集成-ci-设计"},{"level":2,"text":"持续交付（CD）设计","id":"持续交付-cd-设计"},{"level":2,"text":"模型质量门控","id":"模型质量门控"},{"level":2,"text":"GitOps for ML","id":"gitops-for-ml"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"流水线编排与调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/pipeline/pipeline-orchestration"},"next":{"title":"模型服务架构模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/serving/model-serving-patterns"}}